{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Project OBSCURE</strong> is a physics-based first-person puzzle game where you manipulate objects using the power of light.<br><br>Command objects using the power of &quot;Light&quot; and explore the forgotten chambers of an old facility. Harness the Law of Inertia\u2014the first law of motion\u2014and manipulate objects with the help of your flashlight. We aim to bring a fresh perspective to the puzzle genre, a mixture of both lively and realistic mechanics.  <br><br>As you progress, uncover secrets and prepare yourself for mind-boggling puzzles. Prepare yourself for an atmospheric steampunk experience. May the light guide you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcf0 CUTTING EDGE TECHNOLOGIES FROM QUARK CORP!!!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>S-8 GRAVITON</i></strong><i> is a groundbreaking invention from <strong>QUARK CORP</strong>. It enlarges when exposed to light and shrinks back to its original size when the lights turn off. SIZE SOMETIMES MATTERS!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/scale_object.gif?t=1749655574\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>While our beloved <strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> changes its size, its weight also changes accordingly. But keep in mind \u2014 EXCESS OF ANYTHING IS BAD.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/chain_break.gif?t=1749655574\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The <strong>S-8 GRAVITON</strong> is now levitating \u2014 thanks to our cutting-edge technology, the &quot;<strong>F-0 FLUX</strong>&quot; NOT YOUR USUAL FLASHLIGHT.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/focus_mode.gif?t=1749655574\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>But sometimes, it becomes just an ordinary flashlight, helping you open gates. Here at <strong>QUARK CORP</strong>, everything is high-tech \u2014 SO YOU WON'T NEED TO SEARCH FOR THE KEYS.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/mode_change.gif?t=1749655574\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>L-3 PHOTON</i></strong> is just an ordinary sidekick of <strong><i>S-8 GRAVITON</i></strong> . It absorbs light and emits it. WHAT A COPYCAT!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/extras/light_object.gif?t=1749655574\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692740?t=1749655574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692740?t=1749655574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/67a66d84dedfdbe8ad65f2bb3634ece79004fcbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749655574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692740/67a66d84dedfdbe8ad65f2bb3634ece79004fcbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749655574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"co